":"Sen. Cassidy, Bill [R-LA]","party":"R","state":"LA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-03-27","actionDesc":"Introduced in Senate","text":"<p><strong>Restore Protections for Dialysis Patients Act</strong></p><p>This bill specifies certain requirements for private health insurers regarding coverage of individuals with end stage renal disease (ESRD) who are also covered under Medicare.&nbsp;</p><p>In particular, the bill specifies that insurers may not limit benefits, including limiting network composition, in a manner that will affect ESRD Medicare beneficiaries differently compared to others without ESRD. The bill additionally specifies that insurers are not required to include a particular renal dialysis provider or a particular number of such providers as part of their networks.&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2026-03-20T19:34:03Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Restore Protections for Dialysis Patients Act","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-03-20T19:34:44Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-03-20T19:34:44Z"}
